  "content": {
   "rendered": "<div id=\"\" class=\"hds-media-detail-hero nasa-gb-align-wide width-full maxw-full margin-y-5 desktop:margin-y-7 padding-x-3 media-detail-hero--suppress-inner-media-caption hds-module alignwide wp-block-nasa-blocks-media-detail-hero\">\t<div class=\"grid-container grid-container-block padding-x-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"label margin-bottom-1\">APOD</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"heading-22 margin-top-0 margin-bottom-2\">Astronomy Picture of the Day</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"p-md margin-top-0 margin-bottom-3 media-detail-hero__subtext\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/apod/archive/\">Discover the cosmos!</a> Each day a different image or photograph of our fascinating universe is featured, along with a brief explanation written by a professional astronomer.\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media-detail-hero__media margin-bottom-6\">\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"\" class=\"hds-media hds-module wp-block-image\"><div class=\"margin-left-auto margin-right-auto nasa-block-align-full\"><div class=\"hds-media-wrapper margin-left-auto margin-right-auto\"><figure class=\"hds-media-inner hds-cover-wrapper hds-media-ratio-fit \" style=\"--hds-image-contain-bg:#ffffff;\"><a href=\"https://assets.science.nasa.gov/content/dam/science/cds/apod/apod/2024/june/N00172886_92_beltramini.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"See Explanation. Clicking on the picture will download the highest resolution version available. (opens in a new tab)\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"982\" height=\"977\" src=\"https://assets.science.nasa.gov/content/dam/science/cds/apod/apod/2024/june/N00172886_92_beltramini.jpg?w=982&amp;h=977&amp;fit=clip&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint\" class=\"attachment-982x977 size-982x977\" alt=\"See Explanation. Clicking on the picture will download the highest resolution version available.\" style=\"transform: scale(1); transform-origin: 50% 50%; object-position: 50% 50%; object-fit: cover;\" block_context=\"nasa-block\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://assets.science.nasa.gov/content/dam/science/cds/apod/apod/2024/june/N00172886_92_beltramini.jpg?w=982&amp;h=977&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 982w, https://assets.science.nasa.gov/content/dam/science/cds/apod/apod/2024/june/N00172886_92_beltramini.jpg?w=150&amp;h=149&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 150w, https://assets.science.nasa.gov/content/dam/science/cds/apod/apod/2024/june/N00172886_92_beltramini.jpg?w=300&amp;h=298&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 300w, https://assets.science.nasa.gov/content/dam/science/cds/apod/apod/2024/june/N00172886_92_beltramini.jpg?w=768&amp;h=764&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 768w, https://assets.science.nasa.gov/content/dam/science/cds/apod/apod/2024/june/N00172886_92_beltramini.jpg?w=50&amp;h=50&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 50w, https://assets.science.nasa.gov/content/dam/science/cds/apod/apod/2024/june/N00172886_92_beltramini.jpg?w=100&amp;h=99&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 100w, https://assets.science.nasa.gov/content/dam/science/cds/apod/apod/2024/june/N00172886_92_beltramini.jpg?w=200&amp;h=199&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 200w, https://assets.science.nasa.gov/content/dam/science/cds/apod/apod/2024/june/N00172886_92_beltramini.jpg?w=400&amp;h=398&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 400w, https://assets.science.nasa.gov/content/dam/science/cds/apod/apod/2024/june/N00172886_92_beltramini.jpg?w=600&amp;h=597&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 600w, https://assets.science.nasa.gov/content/dam/science/cds/apod/apod/2024/june/N00172886_92_beltramini.jpg?w=900&amp;h=895&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 900w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 85rem) calc(100vw - 3rem), 85rem\" /></a></figure></div></div></div>\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"display-48 margin-top-0 margin-bottom-3\">Stereo Helene</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grid-row media-detail-hero__content-row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grid-col-12 desktop:grid-col-6\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"p-md margin-0 media-detail-hero__description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Explanation:</strong> Get out your red/blue glasses and float next to Helene, small, icy moon of Saturn. <a href=\"https://solarsystem.nasa.gov/moons/saturn-moons/helene/in-depth/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Appropriately named, Helene</a> is a Trojan moon, so called because it orbits at a <a href=\"https://science.nasa.gov/resource/what-is-a-lagrange-point/\" target=\"_blank\">Lagrange point</a> . A Lagrange point is a gravitationally stable position near two massive bodies, in this case <a href=\"https://solarsystem.nasa.gov/moons/saturn-moons/overview/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Saturn and larger moon Dione</a> . In fact, irregularly shaped ( about 36 by 32 by 30 kilometers) Helene orbits at Dione&#8217;s leading Lagrange point while brotherly ice moon Polydeuces follows at Dione&#8217;s trailing Lagrange point. <a href=\"http://space-3d-images.blogspot.com/2011/06/ helene-3d-cassini-cattura-la-regina-del.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The sharp stereo anaglyph</a> was constructed from two Cassini images captured during <a href=\"https://solarsystem.nasa.gov/missions/cassini/overview/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">a close flyby</a> in 2011. It shows part of the Saturn-facing hemisphere of Helene mottled with craters and gully-like features.\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"display-none desktop:display-block desktop:grid-col-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grid-col-12 desktop:grid-col-5 margin-top-3 desktop:margin-top-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table class=\"media-detail-hero__meta-table width-full\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr class=\"media-detail-hero__meta-row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\" class=\"label padding-y-1\">Date</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"p-sm padding-y-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tJune 1, 2024\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr class=\"media-detail-hero__meta-row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\" class=\"label padding-y-1\">Credit</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"p-sm padding-y-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Image Credit:  <a href=\"http://ciclops.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cassini Imaging Team</a> , <a href=\"http://ciclops.org/iss/iss.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ISS</a> , <a href=\"http://www.jpl.nasa.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">JPL</a> , <a href=\"http://www.esa.int/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ESA</a> , <a href=\"http://www.nasa.gov/ \" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NASA</a> ; Stereo Image by <a href=\"http://space-3d-images.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Roberto Beltramini</a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr class=\"media-detail-hero__meta-row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\" class=\"label padding-y-1\">Authors &amp; editors:</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"p-sm padding-y-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.mtu.edu/physics/department/faculty/nemiroff/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Robert Nemiroff</a> (<a href=\"https://www.mtu.edu/physics/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MTU</a>) &amp; <a href=\"https://inspirehep.net/authors/1073087\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Jerry Bonnell</a> (<a href=\"https://www.astro.umd.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">UMCP</a>)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr class=\"media-detail-hero__meta-row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\" class=\"label padding-y-1\">A service of:</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"p-sm padding-y-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://science.gsfc.nasa.gov/astrophysics/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ASD</a> at <a href=\"https://www.nasa.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NASA</a> / <a href=\"https://www.nasa.gov/centers/goddard/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GSFC</a>,<br /><a href=\"https://science.nasa.gov/learn/about-science-activation/\" target=\"_blank\">NASA Science Activation</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.mtu.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Michigan Tech. U.</a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n"
